flowchart LR
  A([Friend taps invite link]):::start --> B[Trip preview<br/>concert · cost per person · who's in]
  B --> C{Choice}
  C -- Not this time --> X[Organiser notified]:::fin
  C -- Maybe --> M[Status Maybe<br/>reminder before deadline]
  M --> C
  C -- I'm in --> D{Has account?}
  D -- No --> E[Sign in: Google or phone OTP<br/>name + contact only]
  D -- Yes --> F
  E --> F{Link forwarded by<br/>someone else & approval on?}
  F -- Yes --> G[Admin approves / declines]
  G -- Declined --> Y[Request closed]:::fin
  G -- Approved --> H
  F -- No --> H[Joins squad]
  H --> I[Sets savings target<br/>friends see % only]:::fin
  classDef start fill:#C6F45B,stroke:#14111F
  classDef fin fill:#14111F,color:#F3EEFF,stroke:#14111F
